            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 2,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 145,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "— Ты уверен, что всё в порядке, старик? — резко спросил один из полицейских. — все твои звери на месте?\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 3,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 149,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "Луч фонаря скользнул по вольеру. Вы вжались в землю, дыхание, казалось остановилось. Луч осветил стаю. Скользнул по вам.\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 4,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 153,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "— А ну-ка, вот на этого ещё раз!\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 5,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 157,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "Луч вернулся назад. Вы замерли, мускулы напружинились.\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 6,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 161,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "— Этот вроде не похож на моих... А что это у него на шее такое? Телефон?\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 7,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 165,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "Вы решили не выяснять, что у вас такое на шее, вместо этого, оттолкнувшись лапами, совершили ещё один головокружительный прыжок, перемахнули через ограду и помчались вниз по аллее прочь.\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 8,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
            "room_text": "",
            "action_text": "",
            "objects_text": "",
            "player_text": "",
            "wolfiness": "1",
            "hp": "2",
            "barExit": "false",
            "forestExit": "false",
            "wolvesTalk": "false",
            "guardDone": "false",
            "end_screen": false
          },
          {
            "seq": 169,
            "kind": "scene",
            "command": "click true,1,960,540",
            "arguments": "",
            "rendered": "Полицейские явно не обладали вашими рефлексами и поначалу замерли, как вкопанные, но затем выхватили оружие и начали стрелять вам вслед.\n",
            "page_id": "30f2da3a-76a3-40b2-84f0-41714eb48ae4",
            "location_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "room_id": "v_30f2da3a_76a3_40b2_84f0_41714eb48ae4",
            "screen_kind": "page",
            "page_name": "Am I a Monster?",
            "background": "images/1.5.jpg",
            "portion_index": 9,
            "portion_count": 11,
            "more": true,
